<div class="page">
<header class="hero">
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <div class="hero-layout">
      <%= image_tag "george.png",
            alt: "George Barkin",
            class: "hero-photo" %>
      <div class="hero-text">
        <p class="hero-kicker">Hi, I'm George</p>
        <h1 class="hero-title">
          Product Manager + Tinkerer
        </h1>

        <p class="hero-subtitle">
         Mix of professional and personal.  Place to explore, demo new ideas, talk about product management and share music.
        </p>

        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a href="#sections" class="btn btn-primary">Explore my work</a>
          <a href="/blog" class="btn btn-ghost">Read the blog</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>


  <main id="sections" class="content">
    <section class="grid">
      <a href="/projects" class="card">
        <div class="card-icon">🚀</div>
        <h2 class="card-title">Projects</h2>
        <p class="card-body">
          Ideas, experiments, apps, works in progress.
        </p>
        <span class="card-link">View projects →</span>
      </a>

      <a href="/product-management" class="card">
        <div class="card-icon">🧭</div>
        <h2 class="card-title">Product Management</h2>
        <p class="card-body">
          Roadmaps, frameworks, and stories from building data-heavy,
          mission-critical products.
        </p>
        <span class="card-link">Explore product work →</span>
      </a>

      <a href="/blog" class="card">
        <div class="card-icon">✍️</div>
        <h2 class="card-title">Blog</h2>
        <p class="card-body">
          Writing on tech, strategy, and whatever I'm currently obsessed with.
        </p>
        <span class="card-link">Read posts →</span>
      </a>

      <a href="/music" class="card">
        <div class="card-icon">🎸</div>
        <h2 class="card-title">Music</h2>
        <p class="card-body">
          Music I play, music I like, videos.
        </p>
        <span class="card-link">Listen and watch →</span>
      </a>
    </section>

    <section class="about">
      <h2>What ties it all together?</h2>
      <p>
        I like building systems that make complex things feel simple — whether that’s
        a workflow for asylum vetting, a machine learning model, a product roadmap,
        or a riff that finally feels right.
      </p>
      <p>
        This site is a living notebook of that work. Over time, each section will grow
        with deeper case studies, experiments, and projects.
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="footer">
    <p>© <%= Time.current.year %> George Barkin · Built with Ruby on Rails in GitHub Codespaces</p>
  </footer>
</div>
